msgstr "Puedes obtener el registro de cambios completo de  link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.11.0.CR1[2.11.0.CR1],  link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.11.0.Final[2.11.0.Final] y  link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.11.1.Final[2.11.1.Final] en GitHub."

